 <p><b>Renderer</b>: Native draws the game directly with Vulkan and is much faster; Xenia (emulated) is the fallback if Native shows something wrong.<br>
 <b>Driver</b>: Automatic uses the built-in Turnip on Adreno 7xx/8xx and the phone\'s own driver elsewhere. You can install another one from the menu.<br>
 <b>Frame rate</b>: 30 is cooler and kinder to the battery; 60 is smoother.<br>
+<b>Widescreen</b> (Dragon Age only): fills the screen\'s width instead of black bars; turn it off if the picture looks wrong.<br>
 <b>Texture detail</b>: lower it if the game runs out of memory.</p>
 
